    "Password" : {

    },
    "Password rejected — reconnect" : {

    },
    "Pick a date…" : {

    },
    "Pikos couldn't open your notes." : {

    },
    "Pikos is notes, tasks and a calendar in one place. Everything you write is stored in a database on this device. There is no account, and nothing is sent anywhere.\n\nA page is a note until you give it a date. Then it is on your calendar too. Tick the ring beside a page to finish it.\n\nThe fastest way in is the + button. Type a sentence and Pikos reads the details out of it:\n\nCall the dentist tomorrow at 3pm !high #health\nStandup every weekday at 9:30 !r10\nPay rent every month on the 1st\n\nSwipe a row to complete or delete it. Tap the title at the top of the list to switch between Today, Upcoming, your Inbox and your folders.\n\nSettings › Your data shows how big your workspace is and puts a copy of it in the Files app whenever you like.\n\nDelete this page whenever you like." : {

